  <diagram id="diag_5_21_other_edge_cases" name="5.21 Other Edge Cases Without Screenshots">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="950" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1860" pageHeight="1189" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="header_title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#1e293b;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial;" value="&lt;b&gt;5.21 Other Edge Cases Without Screenshots&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="220" y="25" width="900" height="35" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_intro" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#f59e0b;strokeWidth=1.6;fontColor=#b45309;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial;" value="These states need a change to the data or a browser pop-up, so they are described here instead of captured. Capture each one from the running app, add it as its own numbered page and delete the card." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="220" y="75" width="1300" height="56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card_1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1e293b;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;Overview: nothing to review&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;When no tutor application or course is waiting, the red band changes to a quiet &#39;Nothing needs your review&#39; with &#39;New tutor applications and course submissions will appear here.&#39;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The count bubbles on the Course moderation and Tutor applications tabs disappear.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#94a3b8;&quot;&gt;Screenshot: not captured yet&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="220" y="155" width="640" height="162" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card_2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1e293b;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;Delete a course&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A browser pop-up asks: &#39;Delete this course permanently, with its lessons, quiz, challenge and discussions?&#39; and says how many enrolled students lose access.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A course can be deleted in any status. Its cover image and lesson attachments are removed too.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#94a3b8;&quot;&gt;Screenshot: not captured yet&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="880" y="155" width="640" height="162" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card_3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1e293b;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;Delete a user&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Delete only works for an account with no activity. The Edit page says &#39;This account has no activity, so it can be deleted.&#39; and the pop-up asks &#39;Delete this account permanently?&#39;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With activity, the Edit page hides Delete and the Users list greys it out. Suspend the account instead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#94a3b8;&quot;&gt;Screenshot: not captured yet&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="220" y="337" width="640" height="208" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card_4" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1e293b;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;Create user: error messages&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#39;That username is already taken.&#39;  &#39;That email is already registered.&#39;  &#39;Passwords do not match.&#39;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#39;Password must be at least 8 characters and include a letter, a number and a symbol.&#39;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;On success the new account opens with &#39;Account created. Give the user their password so they can log in.&#39;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#94a3b8;&quot;&gt;Screenshot: not captured yet&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="880" y="337" width="640" height="208" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card_5" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1e293b;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;Edit user: after saving&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A role change shows &#39;Saved. &amp;lt;name&amp;gt; is logged out on their next click, then logs in with the new role.&#39;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Saving with nothing changed shows &#39;There were no changes to save.&#39;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;An email that another account uses shows &#39;That email is already registered.&#39;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#94a3b8;&quot;&gt;Screenshot: not captured yet&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="220" y="565" width="640" height="172" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card_6" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1e293b;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;Tutor application: rejected, or decided by another admin&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rejected: &#39;Rejected. The applicant can update their details and resubmit.&#39; The reason is shown under the status.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If another admin decided first, the message says &#39;This application has already been approved&#39; (or rejected).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#94a3b8;&quot;&gt;Screenshot: not captured yet&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="880" y="565" width="640" height="172" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card_7" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1e293b;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;Audit logs: empty database, and paging&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;On a new database: &#39;No activity has been recorded yet.&#39;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A page number past the end shows the last page. Search matches the user, the action or the details.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#94a3b8;&quot;&gt;Screenshot: not captured yet&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="220" y="757" width="640" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card_8" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1e293b;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;Database backups: empty and failures&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#39;There are no backups yet. Run one to create the first.&#39;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If SQL Server cannot write the file: &#39;The backup could not be created. Please try again.&#39; No entry is added.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A download of a file that was removed: &#39;This backup could not be found. It may have been removed.&#39;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#94a3b8;&quot;&gt;Screenshot: not captured yet&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="880" y="757" width="640" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card_9" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1e293b;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;What the affected user sees&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A suspended user who tries to sign in sees &#39;This account has been suspended. Please contact an administrator.&#39;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A user who is already signed in is logged out on their next click when they are suspended, deleted or given a new role.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#94a3b8;&quot;&gt;Screenshot: not captured yet&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="220" y="967" width="640" height="162" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card_10" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1e293b;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;Two admins, or a stale page&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If the record changed first, the message names its current state, for example &#39;This course is Published, so it cannot be approved.&#39;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The same applies to users (&#39;This account is Suspended, so it cannot be suspended.&#39;) and tutor applications.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#94a3b8;&quot;&gt;Screenshot: not captured yet&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="880" y="967" width="640" height="162" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
